## 🎯 Key Takeaways

- Linux is inspired by UNIX.
- MINIX inspired Linus Torvalds to create Linux.
- Linux Kernel was first released in 1991.
- GNU tools completed the operating system.
- Linux is free, open source, secure, and community-driven.
- Today Linux powers billions of devices worldwide.
